1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,433
This is Episode 36.

3
00:00:07,433 --> 00:00:10,585
Maya needs three jobs done.

4
00:00:10,585 --> 00:00:12,087
Cups.

5
00:00:12,087 --> 00:00:13,989
Then mixing.

6
00:00:13,989 --> 00:00:15,890
Then pouring.

7
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,792
She claps.

8
00:00:17,792 --> 00:00:20,638
Everyone starts at once.

9
00:00:20,638 --> 00:00:22,234
Oh no!

10
00:00:22,234 --> 00:00:25,731
Lulu pours before the cups are there.

11
00:00:25,731 --> 00:00:27,553
What a mess.

12
00:00:27,553 --> 00:00:30,199
Here comes the staircase.

13
00:00:30,199 --> 00:00:33,324
Sammy steps on the first step.

14
00:00:33,324 --> 00:00:35,172
It lights up.

15
00:00:35,172 --> 00:00:37,646
He sets out the cups.

16
00:00:37,646 --> 00:00:40,598
Now the second step lights.

17
00:00:40,598 --> 00:00:42,606
Eddie mixes.

18
00:00:42,606 --> 00:00:45,505
Now the third step lights.

19
00:00:45,505 --> 00:00:47,579
Lulu pours.

20
00:00:47,579 --> 00:00:49,933
The flag pops up.

21
00:00:49,933 --> 00:00:52,393
One step at a time.

22
00:00:52,393 --> 00:00:55,678
Each step waits for the one before.

23
00:00:55,678 --> 00:00:58,789
Now you know Step Functions!

24
00:00:58,789 --> 00:01:03,484
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

